{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026gXM3xTjS7W1795129000.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>美國人工智能公司Anthropic，首日於納斯達克市場掛牌，即成為全球第12大市值公司，市值剛剛高於「股神」巴菲特投資旗艦巴郡。</p><p></p><p>以收市價97.17美元計，Anthropic的市值達1.27萬億美元，高過市值1.21萬億美元的巴郡。如果以全面攤薄股權計，即計上認股權等潛在發行股份，公司市值更高達約1.8萬億美元，令公司成為全球10大市值企業。</p><p></p><p>另外有外媒報道，Anthropic今次發售的股份，一般散戶獲分派一成半股份，而有超過一半的機構投資者未能分得股份。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T23:44:29.442496+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":230,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T22:55:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T19:17:34.970071+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T23:37:43.034963+00:00","content_hash":"f2224fcb02650a4f2dfebab74936f8f70c181cf57044bc69e60afd9c033269d5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-19T23:44:29.442496+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}